Datasets
  ShareGPT (ShareGPT_V3_unfiltered_cleaned_split) is used to derive the expert
  popularity ranking and as the primary evaluation workload. C4 (Raffel et al.,
  JMLR 2020) is used as the held-out workload. Neither is redistributed here.
